    <briefdescription>
<para>NLP-powered metadata extractor for document ingestion. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Enriches documents with:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Keywords (TF-IDF based)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Named entities (emails, URLs, dates, measurements)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Language detection</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Content complexity metrics</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Sentiment analysis</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Text statistics </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
